2. Hero Rosters, Stats, Counters, Builds & Guide Sources
--------------------------------------------------------
- Kurohiko (https://hok.kurohiko.id/): Global hero catalog, primary roles,
  directional counter matrix, and Indonesian tactical counter commentary.
- HOKFIRE (https://www.hokfire.com/): Diamond+ statistics, tier benchmarks,
  recommended item/arcana presets, skill/item catalogs, and lane icons.
- HoKStats (https://hokstats.gg/): Offline-imported editorial hero guides,
  item/spell details, and matchup notes, gated behind explicit review hashes
  (`data/mappings/hokstats_*_reviews.json`).

